will see how mature I am!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I haven't slept well in weeks, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Cosa?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Pensi che sia un ragazzino?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000E:}}Ma non è giusto!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ho iniziato a bere sempre tre tazze
